1
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:35,560
Think you're so great?

2
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:38,320
Like you're invincible?

3
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:41,280
Why did you go rogue?

4
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:44,360
Right at the most critical moment,

5
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:45,680
you pulled away the 1st Battalion's main force!

6
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:47,040
Do you realize what you did

7
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:49,760
turned the entire 396th Brigade into a joke?

8
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:52,000
You're asking me why?

9
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:54,360
Fine, I'll tell you.

10
00:01:55,400 --> 00:01:56,800
Because this whole battle

11
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:59,800
was a total disaster from start to finish!

12
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:04,120
We ruined a perfectly good hand.

13
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:06,120
As for the enemy command center's main force,

14
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:07,880
we had wiped out most of their troops.

15
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:09,600
Instead of pressing our advantage

16
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:11,039
to take them down in one fell swoop,

17
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:13,960
we ran off to Jade Emperor Peak for a war of attrition!

18
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,920
Is that how you fight a war?

19
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:18,200
I admit it.

20
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:19,400
I made an error in judgment.

21
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:22,640
But I'm not the reason we lost this battle.

22
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:24,040
Stop making excuses.

23
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:27,720
Guo Zijian!

24
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:31,680
As for the personal grudge between us

25
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,800
and everything you've done in the past,

26
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:35,320
I can let it slide.

27
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,720
But you made a mistake yourself,

28
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,760
and now you're shirking responsibility.

29
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:41,120
You're still making excuses!

30
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:42,400
And slandering Deputy Brigade Commander Suo!

31
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,520
And slandering Deputy Brigade Commander Suo!

32
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:45,920
That is unacceptable.

33
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,920
I'm not trying to slander anyone.

34
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:50,240
Nor am I trying to shirk responsibility.

35
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:53,160
I'm just stating the facts.

36
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:54,800
Who do you think you are?

37
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:56,720
Guo Zijian!

38
00:02:58,480 --> 00:03:00,360
Who do you think you are?

39
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:02,720
Do you think you own this army?

40
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:04,600
What?

41
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:07,240
The 396th Brigade isn't big enough for you?

42
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,920
You think you're so capable?

43
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,760
You just want to climb the ranks, right?

44
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:16,920
Well, let me tell you this.

45
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:20,000
As long as I, Jiang Shengqiang, am here,

46
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:21,680
you won't get your way!

47
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:23,000
In the 396th Brigade,

48
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:25,880
we'll see who the real ace is.

49
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:37,440
Commander Ma.

50
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:40,200
Notify the base personnel in Exercise Control,

51
00:03:40,200 --> 00:03:41,800
no one is allowed to rest tonight.

52
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:44,960
Every issue found during the exercise

53
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:46,680
must be clearly categorized and sorted out.

54
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,960
If we don't hit the mark tomorrow,

55
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:51,280
some people won't be convinced.

56
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:53,040
Understood.

57
00:03:53,160 --> 00:03:53,840
Also,

58
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:56,520
tomorrow, throughout the entire debriefing,

59
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:58,480
when we encounter key points,

60
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:01,160
the Exercise Control comrades will reconstruct the events.

61
00:04:01,640 --> 00:04:02,800
Right, that's a good idea.

62
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:05,080
It saves the trouble of writing paperwork,

63
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,600
and explains the issues thoroughly.

64
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:08,480
It makes it much more targeted.

65
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:12,520
How is the exercise report coming along?

66
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,280
Rest assured, Chief.

67
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,520
It will be completed tonight.

68
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:17,040
I'll send it for your review first thing tomorrow.

69
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:19,079
The data must be clear, accurate,

70
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:19,920
and solid.

71
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:21,040
Yes, sir.

72
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,560
Jian'an,

73
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:35,400
regarding tomorrow's debriefing,

74
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:38,200
do we need to provide some explanations?

75
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:41,400
We got captured alive.

76
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:45,040
What else is there to say?

77
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:48,400
Don't be so emotional.

78
00:04:51,440 --> 00:04:52,560
During this exercise,

79
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:54,920
whether good or bad,

80
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:56,080
the focus

81
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:58,080
was almost entirely on the 1st Battalion.

82
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:00,480
But I always feel like for Guo Zijian,

83
00:05:00,520 --> 00:05:01,040
all of his...

84
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:02,360
Don't mention Guo Zijian to me.

85
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:06,600
Guo Zijian, during this exercise,

86
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:09,840
was nothing but a liability.

87
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:12,080
That's a bit harsh.

88
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:13,200
Is it harsh?

89
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:16,920
If he hadn't abandoned his post,

90
00:05:17,320 --> 00:05:19,640
would I have been captured alive?

91
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:24,080
His head is full of individualism.

92
00:05:24,440 --> 00:05:26,480
All he thinks about is making a name for himself.

93
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:28,760
Lao Suo,

94
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:32,000
I'm also responsible for your capture.

95
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:33,840
But blaming it on Guo Zijian

96
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,480
is too far-fetched, don't you think?

97
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:36,720
Far-fetched?

98
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:38,800
Commissar, think about it carefully.

99
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,360
After the strike on Yellow Stone Ridge,

100
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:45,280
the Chief of Staff and I gave him no orders.

101
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:47,800
When besieging Jade Emperor Peak,

102
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:49,200
I figured

103
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:51,320
this kid is good at unorthodox tactics,

104
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:54,200
so I gave him some leeway to command.

105
00:05:54,200 --> 00:05:54,720
Well,

106
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:57,200
he took all the 1st Battalion's key personnel with him.

107
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:58,960
To wipe out the Opposing Force's command post!

108
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:01,760
Leaving my command post completely exposed.

109
00:06:02,760 --> 00:06:04,480
The attack on our command post

110
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:05,760
was mainly because Long Yuanshan

111
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:07,560
deliberately sacrificed a helicopter formation,

112
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,880
tricking Jiang Shengqiang.

113
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:10,720
Never mind that Guo Zijian wasn't there.

114
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:11,400
Even if he had been,

115
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:12,560
under those circumstances,

116
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:14,120
he couldn't have turned the tide.

117
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:16,000
Couldn't? Who says he couldn't?

118
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,760
If he had returned to defend in time,

119
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:19,840
he could have at least bought our command center

120
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:21,360
some time to evacuate.

121
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,360
No, he...

122
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:23,960
Look at the others.

123
00:06:25,080 --> 00:06:27,080
To protect the command center,

124
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:28,360
they sacrificed themselves.

125
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:29,400
And him?

126
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:34,040
He made his commanders act as cannon fodder for him.

127
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:37,160
What the hell is that?

128
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:41,160
Maybe one day I should call him Chief.

129
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:42,840
No, I should call him Dad!

130
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:43,560
Come on.

131
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:53,040
Don't you agree?

132
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,960
Who does things like that?

133
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:01,080
As brigade leaders,

134
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:03,560
we should take the high road.

135
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:05,480
You think I haven't taken the high road?

136
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:07,760
Out of respect for you,

137
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:11,080
haven't I taken the high road enough with Guo Zijian?

138
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:13,680
Look at him, does he appreciate it?

139
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:15,800
I think

140
00:07:16,320 --> 00:07:17,880
Section Chief Liu's assessment of him

141
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:20,320
is very accurate and fair.

142
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:24,120
Too selfish, too focused on personal fame.

143
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:30,840
Lao Suo,

144
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:33,360
nobody feels good when we lose a battle.

145
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:36,160
But we should look at the facts, not the person.

146
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:38,680
I feel

147
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:41,440
your misunderstanding of Guo Zijian is still quite deep.

148
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:42,760
You just haven't come around.

149
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:43,920
I don't want to come around.

150
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,520
I can't put up with his ego.

151
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:51,680
No, you...

152
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:06,200
Lin Yihu.

153
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:09,480
Battalion Commander.

154
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:12,400
You guys did great today.

155
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:14,000
You made the 1st Battalion proud.

156
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:15,800
Grab your squad leader later.

157
00:08:15,840 --> 00:08:17,080
I'll throw you a private celebration.

158
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:19,280
Squad leader!

159
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:24,440
Squad leader.

160
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:25,920
What's wrong?

161
00:08:27,440 --> 00:08:28,440
What happened?

162
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:33,400
Commissar.

163
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:35,400
I need to request leave.

164
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:36,240
So you've heard.

165
00:08:36,679 --> 00:08:38,440
I was just about to announce it at the meeting.

166
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,760
Please approve my leave, Commissar.

167
00:08:39,760 --> 00:08:41,159
I need to go to the hospital right now.

168
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:44,320
The Exercise Control has already dispatched a helicopter

169
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:46,200
to escort Wu Dongsheng to the 189th Hospital.

170
00:08:46,400 --> 00:08:47,160
Besides,

171
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:48,960
you have the Critique Session tomorrow.

172
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:49,800
You cannot be absent.

173
00:08:49,880 --> 00:08:51,840
I will definitely be back before the Critique Session.

174
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,440
To the meeting.

175
00:08:58,160 --> 00:08:58,960
Commissar!

176
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:01,080
Leave after the meeting.

177
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,000
Comrades.

178
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:06,720
Although the exercise is over,

179
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:09,240
the 396th Brigade's battle

180
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:11,240
has just begun.

181
00:09:13,160 --> 00:09:14,760
I gathered everyone here today,

182
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:16,960
not for a summary or a critique.

183
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:19,360
First, to remind you all

184
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:21,600
to monitor the troops' morale.

185
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,480
Especially the political officers.

186
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,640
You must take responsibility.

187
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:28,320
Don't let morale drop.

188
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:31,040
Second,

189
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:32,680
I want to remind everyone

190
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:34,760
that every officer

191
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:36,440
must keep their eyes

192
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:38,320
wide open and stay sharp.

193
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,080
Third,

194
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,320
I demand

195
00:09:42,800 --> 00:09:43,880
that every troop leader,

196
00:09:44,280 --> 00:09:45,440
after the exercise,

197
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:48,560
refrain from cynical remarks and complaints.

198
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:50,480
Above all, do not make

199
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:51,960
irresponsible comments.

200
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,480
If any such behavior is found,

201
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:56,440
the Party Committee will not tolerate it.

202
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:58,480
It will be dealt with strictly.

203
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:00,760
Now,

204
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,600
here is a situation update.

205
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:07,920
1st Battalion's recon squad leader, Wu Dongsheng,

206
00:10:08,880 --> 00:10:10,480
while heading to the Yellow Stone Ridge area

207
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:12,480
to execute a reconnaissance mission,

208
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,560
got into a vehicle accident.

209
00:10:15,400 --> 00:10:17,160
He has been sent to the hospital for treatment.

210
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:19,000
You are hereby notified.

211
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:33,480
Guo Zijian!

212
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:36,360
How can you make it back over such a long mountain road?

213
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:37,600
Guo Zijian!

214
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,400
You're the 1st Battalion Commander.

215
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:41,640
Can you just calm down?

216
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:44,480
I gave Wu Dongsheng his mission.

217
00:10:45,680 --> 00:10:46,640
I have to go.

218
00:10:57,680 --> 00:10:58,760
Stay safe.

219
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:00,280
Hurry back.

220
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,760
The patient's right leg is severely injured,

221
00:11:30,880 --> 00:11:32,160
and he's lost a lot of blood.

222
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:34,280
He's out of danger now,

223
00:11:34,760 --> 00:11:35,720
but his leg...

224
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:37,560
I'm afraid it can't be saved.

225
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:44,160
Like that exercise you fought in,

226
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:46,400
I think that's what real combat is.

227
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:48,000
So,

228
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:49,920
I feel like I have a direction now.

229
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:51,160
I think

230
00:11:51,880 --> 00:11:53,080
I just want to be a

231
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:55,600
veteran who fights tough battles on the battlefield.

232
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:14,320
How is Wu Dongsheng doing?

233
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:19,560
Lao Sang.

234
00:12:20,880 --> 00:12:22,320
I want to recommend Wu Dongsheng for a commendation.

235
00:12:24,040 --> 00:12:25,920
Wu Dongsheng led his recon squad

236
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:27,600
and provided us with the correct target to strike.

237
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:28,920
His actions merit it.

238
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:30,760
After the summary meeting is over,

239
00:12:31,040 --> 00:12:32,280
I'll gather all the materials

240
00:12:32,280 --> 00:12:33,040
and report it immediately.

241
00:12:33,400 --> 00:12:34,200
Rest assured.

242
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:37,080
Also, regarding the critique session,

243
00:12:37,280 --> 00:12:38,680
I have to give you a heads-up first.

244
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:40,640
No matter what kind of feedback

245
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:42,400
our 1st Battalion

246
00:12:42,880 --> 00:12:43,920
and you personally

247
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:45,040
end up receiving,

248
00:12:45,280 --> 00:12:46,280
there's even a high chance

249
00:12:46,280 --> 00:12:47,880
they'll suggest disciplinary action.

250
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:49,560
I hope you can stay calm.

251
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:51,120
Do not act impulsively.

252
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:52,280
You must keep a good attitude.

253
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:54,360
After all, Wu Dongsheng's case hasn't been finalized yet.

254
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:56,520
Furthermore, our command during this mission

255
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:58,120
arguably skirted the rules.

256
00:12:58,920 --> 00:12:59,920
Either of those issues,

257
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:01,360
if blown out of proportion,

258
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:02,800
will mean serious trouble for us.

259
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:03,400
Got it?

260
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:04,600
Battalion Commander.

261
00:13:06,280 --> 00:13:06,800
Instructor.

262
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:08,360
It's time for the meeting.

263
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:14,360
After repeated reviews by the Exercise Control,

264
00:13:15,040 --> 00:13:16,280
it has been concluded that

265
00:13:16,920 --> 00:13:18,280
during the battle at Yellow Stone Ridge,

266
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:20,520
the Red Force 1st Battalion's

267
00:13:20,920 --> 00:13:23,160
precision strike on the Opposing Force's command post

268
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:24,720
was invalid.

269
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:27,000
Therefore,

270
00:13:27,640 --> 00:13:30,560
the previous battle damage assessment for the Opposing Force

271
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:33,200
is also invalid.

272
00:13:34,360 --> 00:13:36,240
I think I can put it more bluntly.

273
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:38,880
This is cheating.

274
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:44,640
The Red Force's so-called precision strike

275
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:47,480
was actually an act of cheating by their scout

276
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:51,120
that severely violated the rules of the exercise.

277
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:55,760
Why do I say this?

278
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:59,280
Because the coordinates for the Red Force precision strike

279
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:01,800
were transmitted by their scout

280
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,960
after it was confirmed he had been stripped

281
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:05,800
of his personal electronic devices,

282
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:09,200
doing so in clear violation of the rules.

283
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:14,000
Let's just listen first.

284
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,960
Aren't they just smearing the 1st Battalion's name?

285
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:22,680
It must be the Opposing Force,

286
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:23,560
who took a massive loss,

287
00:14:23,560 --> 00:14:24,400
playing dirty tricks on us.

288
00:14:25,640 --> 00:14:26,320
Lin Yihu,

289
00:14:26,400 --> 00:14:27,720
why don't you guys head straight there

290
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:29,040
and explain it to the commanders?

291
00:14:29,160 --> 00:14:29,800
Yeah!

292
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:31,560
Otherwise, Squad Leader Wu got hurt for nothing!

293
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:33,080
Yeah!

294
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:34,240
Hurry up and go!

295
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:35,120
Hurry!

296
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:36,360
Go on!

297
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:37,200
Just go!

298
00:14:45,040 --> 00:14:45,880
All set.

299
00:14:57,040 --> 00:14:58,280
This is the video footage

300
00:14:58,280 --> 00:15:00,480
we captured at the time while following

301
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:01,920
the Red Force 1st Battalion's recon squad.

302
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,280
Please note,

303
00:15:04,680 --> 00:15:05,920
this is the time the Opposing Force squad

304
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:08,360
captured the Red Force recon squad:

305
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:10,440
0656 hours.

306
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:11,640
Please look at the video footage.

307
00:15:12,760 --> 00:15:14,560
At that time, all the combat gear

308
00:15:14,560 --> 00:15:15,960
carried by the Red Force members,

309
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:17,680
