310
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:19,280
and electronic devices,

311
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:21,400
had been confiscated by the Opposing Force.

312
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:23,400
According to the exercise rules,

313
00:15:23,520 --> 00:15:25,760
