315
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,880
However, at 0658 hours,

316
00:15:29,040 --> 00:15:32,120
Red Force recon squad leader Wu Dongsheng had an accident.

317
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:33,600
To save a comrade,

318
00:15:33,800 --> 00:15:36,960
Opposing Force counter-recon squad leader Yang Maolin

319
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:39,200
