320
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:51,840
Later, after verification by Exercise Control,

321
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:53,520
the Red Force 1st Battalion command post

322
00:15:53,520 --> 00:15:55,760
received the message at

323
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:58,840
06:59:04 on that day.

324
00:15:59,240 --> 00:16:01,440
And this time difference of over a minute

325
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:03,480
was precisely the time needed to rescue

326
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:06,480
Comrade Wu Dongsheng from the sudden vehicle accident.

327
00:16:07,160 --> 00:16:09,080
At that time, all Opposing Force personnel present

328
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:10,520
rushed to lift the vehicle and save him.

329
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:12,080
However, at this rescue scene,

330
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:15,680
the vice squad leader of the Red Force reconnaissance squad,

331
00:16:15,680 --> 00:16:17,040
Lin Yihu, was notably absent.

332
00:16:17,800 --> 00:16:20,200
So, where was Red Force Vice Squad Leader Lin Yihu?

333
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:28,400
Afterward, Exercise Control found that the signature ID

334
00:16:28,400 --> 00:16:30,560
of the message received by the Red Force 1st Battalion command post

335
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:31,960
was exactly the ID

336
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:35,400
of the handheld device carried by Lin Yihu.

337
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:36,440
Therefore,

338
00:16:36,560 --> 00:16:37,840
based on all the facts,

339
00:16:38,040 --> 00:16:39,520
Lin Yihu took advantage of

340
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:41,680
the time everyone was rescuing Wu Dongsheng

341
00:16:41,680 --> 00:16:44,320
to retrieve the BeiDou device confiscated upon his capture,

342
00:16:44,400 --> 00:16:45,360
reuse it,

343
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:46,880
and send a message.

344
00:16:46,880 --> 00:16:47,800
This constitutes

345
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:49,480
a severe violation.

346
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:57,600
Based on all the facts,

347
00:16:57,800 --> 00:16:59,280
Lin Yihu took advantage of

348
00:16:59,280 --> 00:17:01,440
the time everyone was rescuing Wu Dongsheng

349
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:04,079
to retrieve the BeiDou device confiscated upon his capture,

350
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:05,119
reuse it,

351
00:17:05,119 --> 00:17:06,640
and send a message.

352
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:07,560
This constitutes

353
00:17:07,599 --> 00:17:09,240
a severe violation.

354
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:14,040
Next,

355
00:17:14,599 --> 00:17:17,359
please welcome the Chief Director and General Commander of the exercise,

356
00:17:17,880 --> 00:17:20,319
Deputy Corps Commander Liang Beihua, to speak.

357
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:32,080
The applause is very enthusiastic.

358
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:34,920
But I find it very grating.

359
00:17:35,800 --> 00:17:37,680
Today is the summary of the exercise.

360
00:17:39,400 --> 00:17:40,480
I am here

361
00:17:41,120 --> 00:17:42,120
only to discuss problems,

362
00:17:43,720 --> 00:17:44,680
not to give praise.

363
00:17:46,400 --> 00:17:47,560
To be honest,

364
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:49,920
at the beginning of this exercise,

365
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:51,480
I was full of expectations.

366
00:17:52,560 --> 00:17:54,280
I thought that through this exercise,

367
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:55,800
for our

368
00:17:56,120 --> 00:17:57,360
training transformation,

369
00:17:57,960 --> 00:18:00,160
we could absorb abundant nourishment.

370
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:02,280
However,

371
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:05,080
as soon as the Red Force and Opposing Force clashed,

372
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:07,920
my expectations were greatly reduced.

373
00:18:09,560 --> 00:18:10,720
Looking at it now,

374
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:11,960
there is nourishment,

375
00:18:12,360 --> 00:18:13,360
but

376
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:15,000
it's malnutrition.

377
00:18:16,800 --> 00:18:18,560
Just now, comrades from Exercise Control

378
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:20,600
went over each phase of the exercise

379
00:18:20,680 --> 00:18:21,800
and conducted a debriefing.

380
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:23,880
What they mentioned were specific problems

381
00:18:24,040 --> 00:18:25,120
and specific incidents.

382
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:28,720
What I want to say here is,

383
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:32,480
from beginning to end on this exercise field,

384
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:36,480
it was permeated by a strong sense of careerism.

385
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:38,840
Seeking quick success,

386
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:41,160
and being opportunistic.

387
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:43,160
What are you playing at?

388
00:18:46,600 --> 00:18:47,840
If things go on like this,

389
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:50,320
how can we advance the

390
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:51,440
innovation and development of combat capabilities?

391
00:18:51,760 --> 00:18:53,720
How can we shoulder the army transformation's

392
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:54,840
tasks and missions?

393
00:18:56,040 --> 00:18:57,600
These past few days, I've been thinking about

394
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:00,320
what kind of battlefield the future army

395
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:03,800
will fight the enemy on.

396
00:19:05,040 --> 00:19:06,160
But I think,

397
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:08,040
no matter what battlefield it is,

398
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:09,520
like in this exercise,

399
00:19:09,520 --> 00:19:12,040
the repeated fighting for Jade Emperor Peak,

400
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:13,520
in the future,

401
00:19:13,840 --> 00:19:15,600
will be very rare to encounter.

402
00:19:17,120 --> 00:19:17,800
Comrades,

403
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:20,840
at the beginning of the exercise,

404
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:23,880
I equipped the Red Force and Opposing Force with drones,

405
00:19:23,880 --> 00:19:25,440
as well as some smart equipment.

406
00:19:26,240 --> 00:19:27,080
However,

407
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:29,280
throughout the entire exercise,

408
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:32,760
both sides only used them

409
00:19:32,760 --> 00:19:34,960
as mere window dressing and auxiliary aids.

410
00:19:37,080 --> 00:19:39,280
It's truly disappointing.

411
00:19:41,480 --> 00:19:42,760
I just want to ask,

412
00:19:43,120 --> 00:19:45,360
why did the use of new combat forces

413
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:47,760
in the exercise

414
00:19:48,720 --> 00:19:50,480
fail to show any outstanding performance?

415
00:19:50,760 --> 00:19:52,280
The elements of information warfare,

416
00:19:52,520 --> 00:19:53,600
where are they?

417
00:19:54,720 --> 00:19:55,440
Comrades,

418
00:19:56,800 --> 00:19:58,520
after you return to your barracks,

419
00:19:59,240 --> 00:20:00,920
make a thorough self-criticism

420
00:20:02,560 --> 00:20:04,200
and a thorough self-reflection.

421
00:20:05,640 --> 00:20:09,120
The group army will then organize a special seminar,

422
00:20:09,800 --> 00:20:13,040
and invite National Defense University experts

423
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:14,880
to the site

424
00:20:16,520 --> 00:20:17,760
to answer questions and clear up doubts,

425
00:20:19,320 --> 00:20:20,520
and separate truth from falsehood.

426
00:20:21,920 --> 00:20:22,600
Here is the situation.

427
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:25,840
Except for the units participating in the exercise,

428
00:20:26,320 --> 00:20:28,920
the other units connected via video conference

429
00:20:29,320 --> 00:20:30,720
have now been disconnected.

430
00:20:31,480 --> 00:20:34,400
That is to say, from now on,

431
00:20:35,520 --> 00:20:37,800
it's just us who participated in the exercise.

432
00:20:38,840 --> 00:20:40,200
Did you all hear that?

433
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:44,120
There are no outsiders in the room now, just our own people.

434
00:20:45,040 --> 00:20:46,280
If you have grievances, voice them.

435
00:20:46,920 --> 00:20:48,520
If you've been wronged, speak up.

436
00:20:48,800 --> 00:20:50,080
Don't keep it all bottled up.

437
00:20:51,640 --> 00:20:52,720
Who wants to go first?

438
00:20:57,640 --> 00:20:58,680
Report!

439
00:20:58,840 --> 00:21:01,680
Red Force 1st Battalion Commander Guo Zijian requests to speak.

440
00:21:05,800 --> 00:21:06,400
Go ahead.

441
00:21:08,520 --> 00:21:09,600
Commanders.

442
00:21:09,960 --> 00:21:10,960
Actually,

443
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:13,200
before the recon team set out,

444
00:21:13,640 --> 00:21:15,240
I had already identified this area

445
00:21:15,400 --> 00:21:17,760
as the Opposing Force command post,

446
00:21:17,760 --> 00:21:19,960
and had arranged for my troops

447
00:21:20,480 --> 00:21:22,520
to be ready to strike it at any time.

448
00:21:23,760 --> 00:21:24,680
Battalion Commander Guo,

449
00:21:27,440 --> 00:21:28,840
we have video footage confirming

450
00:21:29,200 --> 00:21:30,600
that you were indeed preparing

451
00:21:30,600 --> 00:21:31,920
to make this area your main target.

452
00:21:32,080 --> 00:21:32,920
However,

453
00:21:33,120 --> 00:21:35,840
first, you lacked precise strike coordinates.

454
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:38,320
Second, you had no specific target information.

455
00:21:38,520 --> 00:21:41,960
Third, you hadn't made the final decision.

456
00:21:42,040 --> 00:21:43,120
Because of this,

457
00:21:43,280 --> 00:21:44,920
you sent out the recon team

458
00:21:44,920 --> 00:21:45,800
to scout and verify first.

459
00:21:46,760 --> 00:21:47,920
But in reality,

460
00:21:48,240 --> 00:21:50,400
long before Wu Dongsheng's team arrived,

461
00:21:51,120 --> 00:21:53,760
the recon detachment assigned to the Red Force

462
00:21:53,760 --> 00:21:55,000
had already been to the site.

463
00:21:55,520 --> 00:21:57,480
Although it was at your request

464
00:21:57,480 --> 00:21:59,000
that brigade leaders dispatched them,

465
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:01,040
during the execution of their mission,

466
00:22:01,040 --> 00:22:01,920
they were all captured.

467
00:22:02,600 --> 00:22:04,560
They didn't even send back

468
00:22:04,800 --> 00:22:05,680
a single message.

469
00:22:05,800 --> 00:22:07,520
So according to what you're saying,

470
00:22:07,600 --> 00:22:09,200
without the recon team's information,

471
00:22:09,360 --> 00:22:11,640
we wouldn't have attacked Yellow Stone Ridge?

472
00:22:11,640 --> 00:22:13,920
Battalion Commander Guo, Exercise Control verified

473
00:22:14,760 --> 00:22:16,600
that you had indeed massed your forces

474
00:22:16,600 --> 00:22:18,080
and were ready to strike Yellow Stone Ridge.

475
00:22:18,120 --> 00:22:19,200
But ultimately,

476
00:22:19,200 --> 00:22:21,560
what allowed you to make the decision and act,

477
00:22:21,760 --> 00:22:24,280
and achieve such a great strike result,

478
00:22:24,520 --> 00:22:25,960
was because of

479
00:22:26,280 --> 00:22:28,440
the precise coordinates sent by Lin Yihu

480
00:22:28,440 --> 00:22:29,240
and the strike targets.

481
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:36,000
That's just your subjective reasoning!

482
00:22:36,160 --> 00:22:37,280
On the contrary,

483
00:22:37,400 --> 00:22:38,480
as a member of Exercise Control,

484
00:22:38,600 --> 00:22:39,840
every word I say

485
00:22:39,840 --> 00:22:41,000
is based on facts.

486
00:22:41,120 --> 00:22:43,000
Are a commander's battlefield decisions

487
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:44,080
worth absolutely nothing?

488
00:22:44,080 --> 00:22:45,720
Any decision

489
00:22:45,720 --> 00:22:47,920
must stem from intelligence and information.

490
00:22:48,320 --> 00:22:49,800
And whether a decision succeeds or fails

491
00:22:49,800 --> 00:22:52,280
relies even more on precise information.

492
00:22:52,560 --> 00:22:54,960
This rule was true in the past, is true now,

493
00:22:55,120 --> 00:22:56,720
and will always be true in the future.

494
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:13,200
This Staff Officer Liang really plays no favorites.

495
00:23:13,600 --> 00:23:15,920
Guo Zijian brought it on himself.

496
00:23:30,600 --> 00:23:31,640
Well said.

497
00:23:48,600 --> 00:23:49,640
In this exercise,

498
00:23:49,960 --> 00:23:52,400
I think the most crucial term is "combined arms".

499
00:23:52,400 --> 00:23:54,760
As for what this term truly means,

500
00:23:55,760 --> 00:23:57,240
both literally and fundamentally,

501
00:23:58,200 --> 00:24:00,160
I hope the Red Force goes back

502
00:24:00,560 --> 00:24:01,920
and thinks it over carefully.

503
00:24:03,320 --> 00:24:05,040
Especially the combined arms units.

504
00:24:05,760 --> 00:24:07,840
If you can't even figure this out,

505
00:24:08,280 --> 00:24:09,600
your future battles

506
00:24:10,440 --> 00:24:11,880
will just end up being a total mess.

507
00:24:17,280 --> 00:24:18,640
After the meeting concludes,

508
00:24:19,120 --> 00:24:21,760
the Red Force and Opposing Force will go back to review.

509
00:24:22,240 --> 00:24:23,480
The comrades at the base

510
00:24:23,680 --> 00:24:25,960
will also use your reasonable suggestions

511
00:24:26,400 --> 00:24:27,640
to conduct an in-depth debriefing.

512
00:24:28,360 --> 00:24:29,280
Remember,

513
00:24:30,600 --> 00:24:32,280
victory or defeat is not the goal.

514
00:24:32,920 --> 00:24:35,920
How to improve combat effectiveness is key.

515
00:24:38,840 --> 00:24:39,920
Meeting adjourned.

516
00:24:40,360 --> 00:24:41,560
Stand up!

517
00:24:54,760 --> 00:24:55,440
Commissar Kang,

518
00:24:56,280 --> 00:24:57,600
we'll be heading back now.

519
00:25:03,120 --> 00:25:04,640
Officers and soldiers of the 396th Brigade,

520
00:25:04,800 --> 00:25:06,120
we, the Opposing Force,

521
00:25:06,120 --> 00:25:07,400
are your whetstone.

522
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:09,160
We hope this blade of yours

523
00:25:09,160 --> 00:25:11,280
grows ever sharper under our honing.

524
00:25:11,440 --> 00:25:12,600
We hope that from now on,

525
00:25:12,800 --> 00:25:15,280
you will grow stronger with every battle.

526
00:25:16,720 --> 00:25:17,240
Chief of Staff!

527
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:17,720
Here!

528
00:25:17,880 --> 00:25:19,920
Lead a song to boost morale.

529
00:25:20,240 --> 00:25:21,560
Yes, sir!

530
00:25:22,400 --> 00:25:23,640
404th, attention!

531
00:25:23,920 --> 00:25:25,360
"Say Fight, We Fight!"

532
00:25:25,360 --> 00:25:27,080
Ready, sing!

533
00:25:27,080 --> 00:25:30,920
Say fight, we fight! Say strike, we strike!

534
00:25:30,920 --> 00:25:32,760
Practice with the guns in our hands!

535
00:25:32,760 --> 00:25:34,680
Bayonets and grenades!

536
00:25:34,680 --> 00:25:38,120
Aim true and throw far!

537
00:25:38,120 --> 00:25:39,920
Fix bayonets!

538
00:26:17,680 --> 00:26:20,280
Staff Officer Liang, maybe I should head out.

539
00:26:20,280 --> 00:26:20,960
Go ahead.

540
00:26:36,120 --> 00:26:37,200
Comrades,

541
00:26:39,360 --> 00:26:43,560
I, Kang Baoping, have lived a long time,

542
00:26:45,440 --> 00:26:47,080
but for the first time,

543
00:26:49,040 --> 00:26:50,440
I'm afraid to step outside.

544
00:27:01,600 --> 00:27:02,640
Guo Zijian,

545
00:27:06,240 --> 00:27:09,120
ever since you entered the exercise area,

546
00:27:10,080 --> 00:27:11,640
you've constantly been

547
00:27:12,560 --> 00:27:15,120
out of step with

548
00:27:16,360 --> 00:27:17,680
the Command Center.

549
00:27:20,480 --> 00:27:22,440
Always showing off

550
00:27:22,960 --> 00:27:26,720
your Master's in Military Command

551
00:27:27,280 --> 00:27:29,600
and academy staff officer

552
00:27:31,040 --> 00:27:32,320
swagger.

553
00:27:33,920 --> 00:27:34,920
Right?

554
00:27:37,240 --> 00:27:39,520
Every single order from our Brigade Command

555
00:27:40,280 --> 00:27:41,880
is beneath you.

556
00:27:43,400 --> 00:27:44,960
If you were actually capable,

557
00:27:46,080 --> 00:27:48,160
I, Suo Jian'an, would respect you.

558
00:27:49,160 --> 00:27:51,160
But look at the things you've done.

559
00:27:51,680 --> 00:27:56,040
Which of them isn't a hard-to-swallow

560
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:58,160
mess?

561
00:28:03,400 --> 00:28:04,360
Let me tell you,

562
00:28:05,760 --> 00:28:07,880
just for disobeying orders alone,

563
00:28:09,880 --> 00:28:11,640
I could strip you of your post.

564
00:28:14,760 --> 00:28:16,600
Scout Squad Leader Wu Dongsheng

565
00:28:17,240 --> 00:28:18,480
went out on a mission.

566
00:28:19,160 --> 00:28:20,200
Why didn't you ask for instructions?

567
00:28:21,480 --> 00:28:23,160
Why didn't you report it?

568
00:28:25,000 --> 00:28:26,120
Now he's severely injured.

569
00:28:26,880 --> 00:28:28,240
With an accident this major,

570
00:28:29,600 --> 00:28:31,560
shouldn't you be reflecting on yourself?

571
00:28:31,720 --> 00:28:34,800
Shouldn't you be taking responsibility and learning from this?

572
00:28:34,880 --> 00:28:37,480
What were you doing in front of the commander?

573
00:28:38,840 --> 00:28:40,440
Making a scene!

574
00:28:43,440 --> 00:28:44,040
Guo Zijian,

575
00:28:46,040 --> 00:28:47,880
if you want to put on a show, fine.

576
00:28:48,360 --> 00:28:51,160
But don't drag everyone down with you.

577
00:28:51,320 --> 00:28:54,400
You might not care about your dignity, but I do!

578
00:29:13,600 --> 00:29:14,520
Acting Brigade Commander Suo,

579
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:20,480
I admit to all the issues you raised today.

580
00:29:23,440 --> 00:29:25,520
With such a major accident during this exercise,

581
00:29:26,920 --> 00:29:27,800
I, Guo Zijian,

582
00:29:28,560 --> 00:29:29,880
won't be a coward.

583
00:29:31,000 --> 00:29:32,040
As for what happened with Wu Dongsheng,

584
00:29:32,880 --> 00:29:34,560
I acted entirely on my own.

585
00:29:34,640 --> 00:29:35,880
It has nothing to do with anyone else.

586
00:29:37,080 --> 00:29:38,280
Whether I'm transferred to civilian work or dismissed,

587
00:29:38,600 --> 00:29:39,960
whatever the punishment may be,

588
00:29:42,720 --> 00:29:43,920
I will accept it.

589
00:30:52,920 --> 00:30:53,560
Sir.

590
00:30:54,680 --> 00:30:56,640
For Guo Zijian, this must be

591
00:30:56,640 --> 00:30:57,720
quite a heavy blow.

592
00:30:59,280 --> 00:31:01,360
Do you think he'll recover from this?

593
00:31:02,480 --> 00:31:03,040
Report!

594
00:31:26,200 --> 00:31:28,360
The situation report submitted by the 396th Brigade

595
00:31:28,720 --> 00:31:31,200
asks for our opinion on how to discipline Guo Zijian.

596
00:31:31,320 --> 00:31:32,160
What do they say?

597
00:31:32,840 --> 00:31:34,320
What do you think they'd say?

598
00:31:34,920 --> 00:31:35,760
I think...

599
00:31:36,680 --> 00:31:37,320
I think...

600
00:31:37,680 --> 00:31:38,760
our Group Army headquarters

601
00:31:38,760 --> 00:31:40,400
should also offer an opinion.

602
00:31:41,080 --> 00:31:42,520
What opinion should we offer?

603
00:31:45,920 --> 00:31:47,080
Everything is arranged.

604
00:31:47,720 --> 00:31:48,240
Good.

605
00:31:48,640 --> 00:31:50,680
All safety inspections for vehicles and equipment

606
00:31:50,680 --> 00:31:51,560
have been completed.

607
00:31:52,080 --> 00:31:54,040
We can head back first thing tomorrow morning.

608
00:32:01,840 --> 00:32:02,480
Wangyuan.

609
00:32:02,760 --> 00:32:03,280
What is it?

610
00:32:04,280 --> 00:32:05,560
About today's meeting...

611
00:32:07,280 --> 00:32:09,560
Did I go a bit too far with my words?

612
00:32:10,320 --> 00:32:10,960
Did you?

613
00:32:11,440 --> 00:32:12,160
I don't think so.

614
00:32:14,360 --> 00:32:15,960
Guo Zijian acted like that today.

615
00:32:16,280 --> 00:32:17,680
If he doesn't get disciplined for it,

616
00:32:17,920 --> 00:32:19,320
I'll be the first to object.

617
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:20,640
Not to mention me,

618
00:32:21,080 --> 00:32:22,400
all the officers and soldiers in the brigade

619
00:32:23,280 --> 00:32:24,040
would object too.

620
00:32:25,240 --> 00:32:26,000
On the contrary,

621
00:32:26,600 --> 00:32:28,480
I actually think you were right to scold him.

622
00:32:28,640 --> 00:32:29,320
It was satisfying.

623
00:32:29,720 --> 00:32:30,480
If it were me,

624
00:32:30,480 --> 00:32:31,440
I'd also call him shameless.

625
00:32:33,360 --> 00:32:34,880
I called him shameless?

626
00:32:35,680 --> 00:32:36,520
Did you forget?

627
00:32:36,720 --> 00:32:37,880
You're talking nonsense.

628
00:32:38,000 --> 00:32:39,840
Would I say something so unrefined?

629
00:32:40,240 --> 00:32:40,840
I said,

630
00:32:41,120 --> 00:32:41,920
"You might not care about your dignity,"

631
00:32:42,120 --> 00:32:43,720
"but I still care about mine!"

632
00:32:45,840 --> 00:32:46,240
Bro,

633
00:32:47,280 --> 00:32:48,800
isn't that the same thing?

634
00:32:51,000 --> 00:32:51,760
I guess so.

635
00:32:55,280 --> 00:32:56,160
Anyway,

636
00:32:57,000 --> 00:32:58,400
the decision on how to handle him,

637
00:32:58,760 --> 00:32:59,800
let's wait a bit longer.

638
00:33:02,640 --> 00:33:04,560
Wait? Wait for what?

639
00:33:05,600 --> 00:33:07,120
Wait for the Group Army leaders' opinion.

640
00:33:07,120 --> 00:33:08,760
No, Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

641
00:33:09,160 --> 00:33:10,840
He was just acting in the role before, yes.

642
00:33:11,160 --> 00:33:12,560
But before this exercise,

643
00:33:12,760 --> 00:33:13,600
his official appointment

644
00:33:13,600 --> 00:33:15,400
was sent directly to our brigade.

645
00:33:15,640 --> 00:33:17,640
Which means he is one of our own now.

646
00:33:18,280 --> 00:33:19,480
We are disciplining our own men,

647
00:33:19,480 --> 00:33:20,800
why do we have to walk on eggshells?

648
00:33:20,800 --> 00:33:22,960
He came from a major headquarters.

649
00:33:23,480 --> 00:33:25,360
He's young but has high seniority.

650
00:33:26,560 --> 00:33:27,760
You don't know squat.

651
00:33:30,880 --> 00:33:31,680
Besides,

652
00:33:32,440 --> 00:33:33,520
he's a young man.

653
00:33:34,480 --> 00:33:35,880
It's inevitable to make mistakes.

654
00:33:36,760 --> 00:33:39,000
Disciplinary action is meant to educate him.

655
00:33:39,600 --> 00:33:40,920
We shouldn't just write him off entirely.

656
00:33:41,600 --> 00:33:43,000
If the punishment is too severe,

657
00:33:44,200 --> 00:33:46,960
it will ruin his career for the rest of his life.

658
00:33:48,040 --> 00:33:50,760
You're always like this.

659
00:33:51,080 --> 00:33:52,640
Sharp tongue, soft heart.

660
00:33:54,360 --> 00:33:55,480
I'm just...

661
00:33:56,840 --> 00:33:57,800
too soft-hearted.

662
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:06,040
Guo Zijian

663
00:34:06,800 --> 00:34:08,719
was an excellent staff officer at the Infantry Academy.

664
00:34:08,960 --> 00:34:11,000
He's also a talent I, Liang Beihua, value highly.

665
00:34:11,760 --> 00:34:13,600
I made him the commander of the 1st Battalion.

666
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:14,960
But all of this

667
00:34:15,320 --> 00:34:17,199
cannot be an excuse to let him off the hook.

668
00:34:18,600 --> 00:34:19,840
You're right, Chief.

669
00:34:21,760 --> 00:34:23,000
This foolish kid,

670
00:34:23,560 --> 00:34:24,760
in front of the whole brigade,

671
00:34:25,120 --> 00:34:25,760
gave the leaders

672
00:34:26,400 --> 00:34:27,480
an attitude and just quit.

673
00:34:28,360 --> 00:34:29,239
He's too stubborn.

674
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:32,280
Commanders can have their own personalities.

675
00:34:32,320 --> 00:34:33,480
Retain their own personalities.

676
00:34:33,800 --> 00:34:35,239
But on matters of principle,

677
00:34:35,239 --> 00:34:36,520
there is no room for negotiation.

678
00:34:38,400 --> 00:34:39,400
I've already signed it.

679
00:34:40,080 --> 00:34:41,600
Guo Zijian belongs to the 396th Brigade.

680
00:34:42,280 --> 00:34:44,560
The Group Army headquarters will absolutely not interfere

681
00:34:44,679 --> 00:34:46,560
with any action taken by the 396th Brigade's party committee.

682
00:34:47,920 --> 00:34:50,400
So you're just going to let him face this alone?

683
00:34:50,800 --> 00:34:53,560
A person's growth requires support from many sides.

684
00:34:53,760 --> 00:34:55,199
But for the few crucial steps,

685
00:34:55,800 --> 00:34:57,120
he has to take them himself.

686
00:35:06,600 --> 00:35:08,440
Staff Officer Liang, what are you doing?

687
00:35:08,440 --> 00:35:09,680
Why aren't you even eating?

688
00:35:15,000 --> 00:35:16,560
Are you still looking at the 1st Battalion's data?

689
00:35:18,600 --> 00:35:19,720
I want to double-check

690
00:35:19,720 --> 00:35:20,800
if there are any mistakes.

691
00:35:21,720 --> 00:35:23,600
After all, it's the first time in an event this big.

692
00:35:23,600 --> 00:35:24,720
And the situation was very complex.

693
00:35:25,120 --> 00:35:26,480
So, did you find anything?

694
00:35:27,480 --> 00:35:27,960
No.

695
00:35:29,120 --> 00:35:29,720
If you ask me,

696
00:35:29,720 --> 00:35:31,240
Guo Zijian is just too arrogant.

697
00:35:31,440 --> 00:35:32,000
The first time,

698
00:35:32,000 --> 00:35:33,640
he correctly guessed the Opposing Force's command post,

699
00:35:33,840 --> 00:35:34,960
and let the victory go to his head.

700
00:35:34,960 --> 00:35:36,520
That's why he took it for granted the second time.

701
00:35:36,880 --> 00:35:38,520
Besides, you know what happens when you stick your neck out.

702
00:35:38,520 --> 00:35:39,600
He's always going against the command post.

703
00:35:39,600 --> 00:35:41,000
How could that end well for him?

704
00:35:45,840 --> 00:35:46,720
Battalion Commander Guo.

705
00:35:47,920 --> 00:35:48,640
Battalion Commander Guo.

706
00:35:50,360 --> 00:35:51,560
Can I speak with you in private?

707
00:35:52,160 --> 00:35:53,200
I've got things to do. I'll get going.

708
00:35:56,640 --> 00:35:57,960
Scared me to death. Scared me to death.

709
00:35:57,960 --> 00:35:59,480
You really shouldn't badmouth people behind their backs.

710
00:36:00,640 --> 00:36:01,240
She...

711
00:36:01,400 --> 00:36:02,600
The conclusion from Exercise Control...

712
00:36:02,880 --> 00:36:05,120
is it final and cannot be changed?

713
00:36:07,560 --> 00:36:08,200
Yes.

714
00:36:11,400 --> 00:36:12,480
Wu Dongsheng's leg...

715
00:36:15,640 --> 00:36:17,720
He might not be able to stay in the army anymore.

716
00:36:19,040 --> 00:36:19,800
This matter

717
00:36:20,440 --> 00:36:21,840
will affect his future benefits.

718
00:36:22,480 --> 00:36:23,880
So I want to ask you

719
00:36:24,600 --> 00:36:26,400
to double-check all the data.

720
00:36:29,480 --> 00:36:30,560
I've already reviewed it.

721
00:36:32,560 --> 00:36:33,440
I'm very sorry,

722
00:36:34,760 --> 00:36:35,960
but facts are facts.

723
00:36:41,640 --> 00:36:42,400
Thank you.

724
00:36:54,400 --> 00:36:55,000
Attention!

725
00:36:55,400 --> 00:36:56,000
Salute!

726
00:37:00,800 --> 00:37:03,280
Watching me so closely. Afraid I'll do something stupid?

727
00:37:05,200 --> 00:37:06,320
Why would you do something stupid?

728
00:37:06,840 --> 00:37:08,360
I'd say you're the last person who would.

729
00:37:09,120 --> 00:37:10,760
What did I tell you before?

730
00:37:11,160 --> 00:37:12,480
I told you to keep a good attitude.

731
00:37:12,480 --> 00:37:13,480
And not to do anything rash.

732
00:37:13,480 --> 00:37:14,600
But what did you do?

733
00:37:14,800 --> 00:37:16,200
If I had just let that go,

734
00:37:16,200 --> 00:37:17,120
and had a good attitude,

735
00:37:17,320 --> 00:37:18,320
would that have solved anything?

736
00:37:19,920 --> 00:37:21,000
Then what do you want to do?

737
00:37:21,000 --> 00:37:21,880
What else can I do?

738
00:37:24,840 --> 00:37:25,800
At worst, I'll transfer to civilian work.

739
00:37:27,440 --> 00:37:28,160
Guo Zijian!

740
00:37:30,120 --> 00:37:31,160
I understand how you feel.

741
00:37:32,280 --> 00:37:33,320
But are those words

742
00:37:33,320 --> 00:37:34,920
something the 1st Battalion commander should say?

743
00:37:37,280 --> 00:37:38,160
Enough.

744
00:37:38,560 --> 00:37:39,800
We head back to camp tomorrow.

745
00:37:40,320 --> 00:37:41,360
Hurry back and get ready.

746
00:38:18,120 --> 00:38:20,600
Lin Yihu, stay. The rest of you, head back.

747
00:38:20,800 --> 00:38:21,440
Fall in!

748
00:38:26,840 --> 00:38:27,800
Dress right, dress!

749
00:38:28,400 --> 00:38:29,160
Ready, front!

750
00:38:29,680 --> 00:38:30,600
Right, face!

751
00:38:31,520 --> 00:38:32,360
Double time, march!

752
00:38:48,440 --> 00:38:49,480
Let's go a round.

753
00:39:04,600 --> 00:39:05,200
Get up!

754
00:39:13,360 --> 00:39:14,480
You've been holding it in, right?

755
00:39:15,960 --> 00:39:16,760
Take it out on me!

756
00:39:16,920 --> 00:39:17,440
Get up!

757
00:39:18,040 --> 00:39:18,640
Get up!

758
00:39:35,760 --> 00:39:36,680
Battalion Commander.

759
00:39:37,680 --> 00:39:38,800
I'm sorry.

760
00:39:42,560 --> 00:39:43,920
I gave the order.

761
00:39:45,920 --> 00:39:46,960
What do you have to be sorry for?

762
00:39:47,400 --> 00:39:47,720
I...

763
00:39:48,680 --> 00:39:50,240
At the time, I just wanted to

764
00:39:50,600 --> 00:39:53,520
send the signal the squad leader mentioned.

765
00:39:55,000 --> 00:39:57,240
I didn't save him right away.

766
00:39:58,200 --> 00:39:58,880
Enough.

767
00:40:01,440 --> 00:40:03,160
Learn from your mistake and fix it.

768
00:40:03,880 --> 00:40:05,120
Next time, before you act,

769
00:40:05,920 --> 00:40:07,040
use your brain first.

770
00:40:07,760 --> 00:40:08,120
Yes, sir.

771
00:40:08,960 --> 00:40:09,480
Understood.

772
00:40:10,680 --> 00:40:11,160
How are you?

773
00:40:12,040 --> 00:40:13,000
Are you over it?

774
00:40:13,840 --> 00:40:14,480
I am.

775
00:40:17,960 --> 00:40:18,800
It's just a bit of embarrassment.

776
00:40:20,400 --> 00:40:21,040
Battalion Commander.

777
00:40:22,440 --> 00:40:23,960
You embarrassed yourself more than I did.

778
00:40:27,160 --> 00:40:28,560
Wanna get thrown another round, huh?

779
00:40:29,320 --> 00:40:30,080
I wouldn't dare.

780
00:40:31,120 --> 00:40:32,400
I know you went easy on me.

781
00:40:41,960 --> 00:40:43,640
That's the situation with Wu Dongsheng.

782
00:40:44,520 --> 00:40:45,200
His leg...

783
00:40:46,760 --> 00:40:47,640
can't be saved.

784
00:40:48,880 --> 00:40:50,200
And he needs surgery immediately.

785
00:40:53,240 --> 00:40:53,800
Alright.

786
00:40:54,880 --> 00:40:56,200
What's done is done.

787
00:40:56,920 --> 00:40:57,840
We must look forward.

788
00:40:58,720 --> 00:41:00,960
Find a way to do what needs to be done.

789
00:41:03,120 --> 00:41:04,560
Especially you, Guo Zijian.

790
00:41:05,240 --> 00:41:06,400
At a critical juncture like this,

791
00:41:06,560 --> 00:41:07,480
I'll say it again.

792
00:41:07,600 --> 00:41:10,080
Do not let your emotions control you.

793
00:41:10,080 --> 00:41:11,920
If you do something reckless again,

794
00:41:14,360 --> 00:41:15,280
the consequences...

795
00:41:16,400 --> 00:41:17,560
will be unpredictable.

796
00:41:31,080 --> 00:41:32,080
Understood, Commissar.

797
00:41:38,040 --> 00:41:38,880
There's one more thing.

798
00:41:39,360 --> 00:41:40,680
Go back and prepare for it.

799
00:41:41,320 --> 00:41:42,760
Wu Dongsheng is having surgery tomorrow.

800
00:41:43,240 --> 00:41:44,880
He needs a lot of fresh blood.

801
00:41:45,960 --> 00:41:46,800
The hospital recently

802
00:41:47,400 --> 00:41:48,720
has had a few major surgeries,

803
00:41:49,240 --> 00:41:51,160
and their blood bank is running low.

804
00:41:51,960 --> 00:41:53,040
I've contacted the hospital.

805
00:41:53,400 --> 00:41:55,280
The 1st Battalion will send some officers and soldiers

806
00:41:55,680 --> 00:41:56,880
to donate blood for Wu Dongsheng.

807
00:41:57,400 --> 00:41:58,200
The medical staff

808
00:41:58,240 --> 00:41:59,320
will arrive today

809
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:01,040
to test everyone's blood.

810
00:42:02,240 --> 00:42:04,400
Organize this well once you get back.

811
00:42:04,880 --> 00:42:05,960
Rest assured, Commissar.

812
00:42:06,640 --> 00:42:08,480
Alright, head back.

813
00:42:26,720 --> 00:42:27,280
Lao Sang.

814
00:42:27,920 --> 00:42:29,680
How is recommending Wu Dongsheng for a commendation going?

815
00:42:30,960 --> 00:42:32,880
I've actually got the paperwork ready.

816
00:42:33,440 --> 00:42:35,000
But after the Critique Session,

817
00:42:35,040 --> 00:42:36,960
the recon squad's merit became a violation.

818
00:42:37,240 --> 00:42:39,000
So things have become complicated now.

819
00:42:39,960 --> 00:42:41,280
It has to be done, no matter how hard.

820
00:42:41,920 --> 00:42:43,080
If he really loses his leg,

821
00:42:43,200 --> 00:42:44,840
how will he survive after leaving the army?

822
00:42:45,400 --> 00:42:45,920
Don't worry.

823
00:42:46,120 --> 00:42:47,360
Given what happened to Wu Dongsheng,

824
00:42:47,720 --> 00:42:49,880
I'll submit this paperwork no matter what.

825
00:42:50,240 --> 00:42:51,440
I'll do everything I can.
